    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Download TikTok Videos Without Watermarks\n\nPaste a TikTok link into a form and get the original video back without the TikTok watermark, in the best quality TikTok serves. Or list links in a Google Sheet and download them all to Google Drive in one run.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Paste a TikTok Link** (a form) or **Run Bulk Download** (a Google Sheet) supplies the links. Full links and app share links (`vm.tiktok.com/...`) both work.\n2. **Load TikTok Video Page** opens the post the way a browser does.\n3. **Find Watermark-Free Video** reads the page data and picks the highest-quality H.264 stream. That's the clean file TikTok's web player uses. The watermarked \"download\" file is never used.\n4. The video downloads as `tiktok_<creator>_<video ID>.mp4`. Photo slideshows download as a `.zip` of the photos.\n5. Form users get the file in their browser. Bulk runs save each file to Google Drive with a view-only link and write the result back to the sheet.\n\n### Setup\n**Form:** nothing to connect. Open **Paste a TikTok Link** and use the test URL, or publish the workflow and use the production URL.\n\n**Bulk download (optional):**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a `tiktok_url` column and paste one link per row.\n2. Connect Google Sheets in **Get Links from Sheet** and **Update Sheet Row**, and pick your sheet from the list in **Get Links from Sheet**. Results are written back to the same sheet.\n3. Connect Google Drive in **Upload to Google Drive** and **Share Link (View Only)**, and pick a folder.\n4. Click **Execute workflow** on **Run Bulk Download**. Status, file name, Drive link, creator, caption and quality columns are added automatically. Rows marked `downloaded` are skipped, so run it again to retry any errors.\n\nOnly download videos you own or have permission to reuse.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "5eba36b0-7704-48f2-80b8-9618efb13784",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1240,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Paste a TikTok link or run a bulk list\nThe form takes one link at a time. Bulk mode reads every row in your sheet that isn't marked `downloaded` yet.\n\n**Read TikTok Link** pulls the TikTok URL out of whatever was pasted. Update the browser ID (User-Agent) here if TikTok starts rejecting requests.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1140,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "14de950e-5ff8-4941-84ec-0310b84952b6",
      "name": "Section 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Find the watermark-free video\nLoads the TikTok page and reads the video data embedded in it.\n\nTikTok lists several versions of each video. This picks the highest-resolution H.264 version, which plays in any app. It never uses `downloadAddr`, the version with the watermark burned in.\n\nPrivate, deleted, region-locked and bot-checked posts get a clear error message instead.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "21d29062-1019-42fd-ab3a-c5752f8822b1",
      "name": "Section 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Download TikTok videos without watermarks\n**Video:** downloads the clean MP4 using the cookies TikTok set when the page loaded, then names it `tiktok_<creator>_<video ID>.mp4`.\n\n**Photo slideshow:** downloads each photo and zips them into `tiktok_<creator>_<post ID>.zip`.\n\nThe finished file is stored in the `tiktokFile` field.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1140,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "741f8c3d-3990-48fc-a7b4-8ffafa5628c5",
      "name": "Section 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Send the file\n**Form:** returns the watermark-free file straight to the browser, or shows what went wrong.\n\n**Bulk:** uploads the file to Google Drive, creates a view-only link (anyone with the link can watch it, nobody can edit it), and writes the result to the sheet. Failed links are marked `error` with the reason.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1240,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "3ff5934f-b562-4095-829d-94d8edd25e5d",
      "name": "Section 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2320,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
